     by fb docx-reference --extract): the cross-engine recipe (tools/fb/src/docxxengine.rs) in the typst template's
     face ({font}, Times New Roman) at 14 pt, Body Text in 31.4 pt line boxes with a half-inch indent, footnotes 14 pt
     (FRAP 32(a)(5)(A)) in 20 pt boxes, exact line spacing (typst pitch-double, pitch-single); widow control off, as in
     the typst template; plus the "CA ..." paragraph styles ca5-answering-brief.lua writes the cover, headings,
     tables and certificates in: single-spaced (20 pt boxes), with the typst template's spaces; heading levels from 4
     bold italic (typst style-heading). Twips: 20 x pt. The footer and the last section here are the recipe's;
     ca5-answering-brief.lua writes the document's own (FORMBOOK_FOOTERS, FORMBOOK_FINAL). -->
